/* ==========================================================================
   NEMOTRON 3.5 LIGHTNING ORCHESTRATION LAYER
   ==========================================================================
   Preferred architecture for AI reasoning and tool orchestration:
   
   User Question
       ↓
   Nemotron 3.5 Lightning
       ↓
   Intent / Tool Selection
       ↓
   Deterministic Analytics Tool (SQL, Pandas, NumPy, scikit-learn, backend libraries)
       ↓
   Verified Result (numerical facts, statistical metrics, analytical findings)
       ↓
   Nemotron 3.5 Lightning
       ↓
   Explanation + Insight + Recommendation
   
   Key Principles:
   - Nemotron never as source of numerical truth
   - All numerical claims originate from executed analytical operations
   - Tool arguments validated before execution
   - Results validated after execution
   - LLM explains; analytics computes
   - Structured function calling where supported
   - No arbitrary code execution from user prompts
   
   Supported Tool Types:
   - Statistical analysis (descriptive stats, correlation, hypothesis testing)
   - ML model training & prediction
   - Forecasting (time-series analysis)
   - Anomaly detection
   - Data profiling & quality assessment
   - Report generation summarization
   - Natural-language-to-SQL translation (assisted)
   
   Integration with Current Stack:
   - Google Gemini (gemini-3.6-flash) via /api/ai/report and /api/ai/copilot endpoints
   - Structured analytical facts passed as context source of truth
   - Backend analytics services: BI, Statistical, ML Pipeline, Edge Functions
   - Pattern: User Question → Nemotron → Tool Selection → Verified Result → Nemotron → Insight
*/

